OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACastle set for dazzling display of
OL,4,Anew daffodil type
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive thousand bulbs of a new variety of
OL,7,Fdaffodil are being planted at the
OL,8,Fchildhood home of Henry VIII's second
OL,9,Fwife, Anne Boleyn, in preparation for
OL,10,Fspring.
OL,12,FThe variety, named Hever Castle, has
OL,13,Fbeen launched thanks to a collaboration
OL,14,Fbetween the Kent estate's head
OL,15,Fgardener, Neil Miller, and
OL,16,Faward-winning daffodil expert Johnny
OL,17,FWalkers.
OL,19,FThe flowers were grown in trial beds in
OL,20,FLincolnshire and the bulbs were then
OL,21,Fsent to the castle estate near
OL,22,FEdenbridge, ready for planting.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
