OL,3,GNEWSACastle set for dazzling display of
OL,4,Anew daffodil type
OL,5,
OL,6,FMiller said: "It's a traditional
OL,7,Fyellow, deep, beautiful kind of
OL,8,Fdaffodil and my goodness me, next March
OL,9,Fit will look amazing."
